{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "SHRINK_FACTOR = 1.3\n\ndef _calculate_gap(gap: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Reduces the gap size by the SHRINK_FACTOR.\"\"\"\n    return max(1, int(gap / SHRINK_FACTOR))\n\ndef _swap_elements(elements: list, i: int, j: int) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Swaps two elements in the list at given indices.\"\"\"\n    elements[i], elements[j] = elements[j], elements[i]\n\ndef comb_sort(elements: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of elements using the comb sort algorithm.\"\"\"\n    n = len(elements)\n    gap = n\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        gap = _calculate_gap(gap)\n        swapped = False\n\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if elements[i] > elements[i + gap]:\n                _swap_elements(elements, i, i + gap)\n                swapped = True\n    return elements"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(array1, array2):\n    # Checks if two arrays follow the same structural pattern.\n    # It extracts a uniqueness-based pattern dictionary for each and then compares them.\n    if len(array1) != len(array2):\n        return False\n\n    def _extract_pattern(arr):\n        # This helper function extracts a pattern dictionary from an array.\n        # Keys are unique elements, and values are lists of all their indices in the array.\n        pattern_dict = {}\n        for i, item in enumerate(arr):\n            if item not in pattern_dict:\n                pattern_dict[item] = []\n            pattern_dict[item].append(i)\n        return pattern_dict\n\n    def _compare_patterns(pattern1, pattern2):\n        # This helper function compares two extracted pattern dictionaries.\n        # It checks if they have the same number of unique elements and identical lists of indices.\n        if len(pattern1) != len(pattern2):\n            return False\n\n        # Compare the sorted lists of index lists (the values of the dictionaries).\n        sorted_indices1 = sorted(pattern1.values())\n        sorted_indices2 = sorted(pattern2.values())\n\n        return sorted_indices1 == sorted_indices2\n\n    pattern1 = _extract_pattern(array1)\n    pattern2 = _extract_pattern(array2)\n\n    return _compare_patterns(pattern1, pattern2)"}
