{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(tuple_list, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds tuples where all elements are divisible by k from the given list of tuples.\n    This function utilizes helper functions for modular divisibility checks.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _is_divisible(element, k):\n        \"\"\"Checks if a single element is divisible by k.\"\"\"\n        return element % k == 0\n\n    def _check_all_elements(tuple_item, k):\n        \"\"\"Verifies all elements in a tuple are divisible by k.\"\"\"\n        for element in tuple_item:\n            if not _is_divisible(element, k):\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    result = []\n    for current_tuple in tuple_list:\n        if _check_all_elements(current_tuple, k):\n            result.append(current_tuple)\n    return result"}
