{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the non-overlapping occurrences of the substring 'std' in the given string.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    pattern = \"std\"\n    pattern_len = len(pattern)\n\n    while True:\n        # Find the next occurrence of the pattern starting from start_index\n        found_index = input_string.find(pattern, start_index)\n\n        # If the pattern is found, increment count and update start_index\n        if found_index != -1:\n            count += 1\n            # Move start_index past the found pattern to ensure non-overlapping counts\n            start_index = found_index + pattern_len\n        else:\n            # If the pattern is not found, exit the loop\n            break\n            \n    return count"}
